<div class="report">
<h1>What's this all about then?</h1>
  
<h2>MetaPig burrows into your website pages separating the truffles from the garbage. Simply put, its a tool that analyses your <strong>website's html</strong> giving you advice on how you can improve on it - enabling better <strong>search engine optimization.</strong></h2>
<p>To get started just type your web page address in the bar above and press the button!<br />

All scores are given as a percentage with the highest score being 100%. If your website makes it into the top 5 it will be shown on the home page for all to see!</p>
<p><strong>Please note:</strong> This is a very early beta version and we will be looking to improve it over time. In particular we want to add more scoring criteria and give more information on how to improve your website in terms of search engine optimization.</p>
<p>We are always looking to improve things, so if you have a neat idea or want to discuss your results - <strong>leave a comment!</strong></p>
<h3>Change Log</h3>
<p>
2.2.09 - Fixed image thumbnail bug<br />
2.2.09 - Removed Alexa as it was no longer working and it was slowing the processing<br />
1.3.08 - Added comments section<br />
15.3.08 - Improved metapigs own SEO<br />
15.3.08 - Added RSS detection<br />
28.3.08 - Added local thumbnail caching<br />
28.3.08 - Added &lt;noframes&gt; detection<br />
28.3.08 - Added <em>Web Design Tools</em> page<br />
29.7.08 - Fixed a glitch that reported too much traffic for blogspot domains<br />
21.11.08 - Removed comments due to massive amounts of spam!
</p></div>
